title: embassyArrival
tags:
---
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kieran chauffeurs you to Embassy, parallel parking neatly next to the sidewalk a down from the main entrance to this - the city's best (and only) British rock club.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][An ominous glow from the neon Union Jack illuminates the sidewalk as you both exit Kieran's vehicle.][/nomarkup] #line:00aef1c
{$kieran}: As I was saying the Embassy is my Sire, Kate's Domain. Off the books, of course, the club's day to day operations are run by her ghoul, Diana. #lastline #line:01bda99
<<jump ArrivalQuestions>>
===
title: ArrivalQuestions
---
-> {$pcName}: You're telling me "ghouls" are real too? <<if CustomVisited("vampiricWeaknesses") == false>> #line:0a1597d 
    <<jump vampiricWeaknesses>>
-> {$pcName}: What do you mean by 'domain'? <<if CustomVisited("whatIsDomain") == false>> #line:091d4cf 
    <<jump whatIsDomain>>
-> {$pcName}: Let's go. #line:0c36d66 
    <<jump letsGo>>
===
title: vampiricWeaknesses
position: 217,-136
---
{$kieran}: Being Kindred is uncharted territory for you. A re-evaluation of your beliefs would be prudent. #line:06a28c3
{$kieran}: When a mortal drinks some of a Kindred's blood, they become creatures subservient to us - ghouls. They share the longevity of their master, given they do not bite the hand that feeds them... #line:03b7150
-> {$pcName}: So we do live forever? #line:02593b4
    {$kieran}:Those who keep away from trouble most certainly can live long enough for it to feel so, but we do not share this prospect in our current situation.
    {$kieran}: I will gladly answer the questions you have about Kindred as soon as we are off the hook. #lastline #line:07bca25
    <<jump ArrivalQuestions>>
-> {$pcName}: What does it take to kill us? #line:0a5e59d
    {$kieran}: Sunlight, fire, decapitation... Dominic's jokes. 
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He adds this with an irritated amusement.][/nomarkup]
    {$kieran}: Though, most of the time, getting on the bad side of someone more influential is enough. But there are things worse than final death. #line:0e9ae35
    <<if Roll ("Intelligence","Occult") >=4>>
        <<jump stakes>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump garlicBread>>
    <<endif>>
===
title: garlicBread
---
-> {$pcName}: Can I not eat garlic bread anymore? #line:0c462b8
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Your remark puts a blink-and-you'll-miss-it smile on his usual stiff and borderline-pessimistic expression.][/nomarkup] 
{$kieran}: I miss food as well - cookies, in particular. That being said, life without those indulgences will not kill you.
{$kieran}: Kindred can no longer take in food as humans do. Our digestive system finds anything but blood... troubling. #line:0be75d2
<<jump ArrivalQuestions>>
===
title: whatIsDomain
---
{$kieran}: The basic concept is identical to the original meaning of the word: a region or territory controlled by a ruler or governmental body.
{$kieran}: This generally still holds true in Kindred society. Domain is only bestowed upon people who have proven themselves in some significant way. #line:06c0d19
-> {$pcName}: Do you have one? #line:0a49f43
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kieran is taken aback by the bluntness of the question, but recovers quickly.][/nomarkup]
{$kieran}: No. I do not. #line:08bef4e
-> {$pcName}: Touchy topic? #line:04bd3c2
{$kieran}: No. Not at all. I'm only surprised you would assume I might have one after such an explanation.
{$kieran}: I'm not a young man, but I am a very young Kindred. One that is yet to earn the standing and influence necessary to claim a Domain. #line:05b714a
{$beast}: Blind leading the blind. #lastline #line:091bec4
<<jump ArrivalQuestions>>
===
title: letsGo
position: -52,-156
---
{$kieran}: We should head in through the back. #line:06b242a 
-> {$pcName}: Why? #line:0c91522 
{$kieran}: That is the special entrance for our kind. It is best if we remain as inconspicuous as possible. We have enough problems already. #lastline #line:0a835f1 
-> {$pcName}: Okay then, back entrance for us. Sounds easy enough. #line:079324d 
===
title: stakes
---
-> {$pcName}: What about stakes? #line:088b4bc 
{$kieran}: A stake to the heart will only immobilize us, invoking a paralysis that we cannot escape from without assistance. #line:0a1de9a 
<<jump garlicBread>>
